        "raw": "<p>I wanted to start a thread to make some challenging scenarios for people to play in the video game. I think it is even more fun now with multiplayer (even though I am still waiting on my tablet).</p><p>I was wondering if people had any really good ideas for fun and/or challenging games. I know that on #SentinelsLive a few weeks ago they mentioned that Christopher gave the designers 2 challenges.</p><p>1. Akash (advanced) vs 3 heroes in Silver Gulch</p><p>2. GW Voss (advanced) vs 3 heroes in Insula Primalis (I think this one is correct)</p><p>Does anyone have any other suggestions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Below are mine that I think are fun. Please note that all fights should be <u><strong>Advanced</strong></u>&nbsp;and hero order does not matter.</p><p><u><strong>Battle of the Faiths</strong></u></p><p>A Final Brawl between all the religions (?) in SOTM</p><p>Gloomy (Skinwalker) vs Nightmist, Ra &amp; Fanatic in Tomb of Anubis (any hero Variant allowed)</p><p><u><strong>Girls Night Out</strong></u></p><p>Girls just want to have a fun night on the town</p><p>Spite vs <em>Girl Heroes</em> in Megalopolis</p><p>Girl Hero Options: Fanatic, Young Legacy, Nightmist, Unity, Visionary, Wraith (any hero Variant allowed)</p><p><u><strong>Captain Planet</strong></u></p><p>The Power is Yours</p><p>Omnitron vs <em>Elemental Heroes</em> in Insula Primalis</p><p>Elemental Heroes: Haka - Earth, Ra - Fire, Tempest - Wind, AZ - Water, AA - Heart (any hero/villain Variant allowed)</p><p><u><strong>Leaders of Men</strong></u></p><p>Leaders of Teams come together to stop a Leader in a showdown</p><p>Citizen Dawn vs Legacy, DW Expat, AA in Silver Gulch</p>",
