        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/{size}/2185_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-22T19:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unfortunatley, most of the ideas I have are for the physical game until some of the new expansions come out...</p><p>but here are some more</p><p><strong>A Powerless Team </strong></p><p>A group of powerless heros fight against those who scorn them</p><p>Citizen Dawn vs Expatriette, Mr. Fixer, and The Wraith (I'm counting the suits as powers, and Hakas backstory implies he's not without powers)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Support Our Planet</strong></p><p>Can a team of supporters beat Mother Earth herself?</p><p>Akash'Bhuta vs Legacy (Regular or Grandpa), Argent Adept, and Visionary (either promo is fine)</p><p>When The Scholar comes out, he's allowed in here as well</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
