        "raw": "[quote=\"ogseamus\"]\n\nI wanted to start a thread to make some challenging scenarios for people to play in the video game. I think it is even more fun now with multiplayer (even though I am still waiting on my tablet).I was wondering if people had any really good ideas for fun and/or challenging games.\n\n<strong>Leaders of Men</strong>\n\nLeaders of Teams come together to stop a Leader in a showdownCitizen Dawn vs Legacy, DW Expat, AA in Silver Gulch\n\n[/quote]\n\nI beat this one!&nbsp; It was surprisingly easy too, though neither Dawn nor SG threw the really bad cards at me.&nbsp; The surprise MVP was Argy&#39;s Scherzo of Frost and Flame, which I almost never use, but used to great effect here - doing 3+3 damage most turns (Galvanize and there was an Explosives Wagon in play).&nbsp; It was, indeed, the kill shot.\n",
